  "title": "Quick Cassoulet",
  "description": "A great combination of beans, smoked sausage and vegetables in an easy one-skillet meal. We&#39;ve been making this so long I can&#39;t even remember where I first got the recipe. It&#39;s a staple when we go camping. My teenage daughter and her friends love it. Serve with a green salad and French bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Beth Stone Strachan"
  ],
